<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Circus downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Circus downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch analyst Naomi Talish reduced the rating on Circus Circus Enterprises Inc to near-term neutral from accumulate and to long-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/8 to 25-3/8.</p>
</text>
